    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A single shape dimension that is either a concrete non-negative integer or a symbolic expression represented as a string. <computeroutput><ref refid="classONNX__LIGHT__NAMESPACE_1_1onnx__optim_1_1OptimDim" kindref="compound">OptimDim</ref></computeroutput> is used by <computeroutput><ref refid="classONNX__LIGHT__NAMESPACE_1_1onnx__optim_1_1OptimShape" kindref="compound">OptimShape</ref></computeroutput> to describe both fully-known and partially-symbolic shapes. </para>
